{"unit_id":"tag:03X7:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n为完整起见，我们陈述并证明所考虑的上同调群（cohomology groups）对于部分宇宙（partial universe）选择的不变性（invariance）。我们将在下文引理 <REF_0001> 中证明小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos）的不变性（invariance）。本引理中使用的记号和术语参见《拓扑（Topologies）》第 <REF_0002> 节。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"partial universe","target_term":"部分宇宙"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"上同调用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"partial universe","target_term":"部分宇宙","context":"大小约定，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性","context":"比较性质，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"景的大小，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"保留重音，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"范畴论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"来源章名，待术语决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YY:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>。设 <MATH_0002> 为概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0006> 的两个大（big）<MATH_0005>-景（sites），并假设前者包含于后者。此时，<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>对于定义在 <MATH_0008> 上的任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0007> 和 <MATH_0010> 的任意对象（object）<MATH_0009>，有 <MATH_0011>。用文字表述：<MATH_0012> 在 <MATH_0013> 上、在较大的景（site）中计算的上同调（cohomology），与 <MATH_0014> 限制到较小的景（site）后在 <MATH_0015> 上的上同调（cohomology）相同。<STRUCT_0003>对于 <MATH_0017> 上的任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0016>，存在 <MATH_0019> 上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0018>，其到 <MATH_0020> 的限制（restriction）与 <MATH_0021> 同构（isomorphic）。<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"景的大小，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"层论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"上同调用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"层的限制，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"层的同构关系，待术语决定。"}],"notes":[]}
