{"unit_id":"tag:04HP:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拓扑斯（topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个景（site）上集合（sets）的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category），参见《景（Sites）》定义 <REF_0001>。因此，通常使用“概形（scheme）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos）”这一说法，指一个概形（scheme）的小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）上层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category）。下面给出正式定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"定义用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"范畴论用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"来源章名，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"保留重音，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"景的大小，待术语决定。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"保留重音，待术语决定。"}],"notes":[]}
